  "uncertain": [
    "Labels are given in an off-board diagram with dot columns; mapping of diagram dot columns to the board's pad columns was matched by pin counts and the square pad positions (right header inner column has the square at 3.3V).",
    "Left side treated as two separate single-row connectors (12-pin outer column and 8-pin inner column) because the inner column is shorter; they could be one partially populated 2-row header.",
    "Board drawing shows only two pads near the bottom center; matching them to the CVBS/GND callouts is an interpretation.",
    "Group names (USB1, USB2, I2S0, UART0/1/2, SPI0, I2C0, LINEIN, LINEOUT) were treated as functions; for the right header 5V box spans two rows, so both outer pins of rows 1-2 take 5V."
  ],
